{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Star Child is an explosive new futuristic action-adventure game built by a small and passionate indie team. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a mysterious alien world full of unique environments, populated by dangerous alien foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/steam_gif_v3.gif?t=1744813123\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer a variety of bosses, each one designed to have a unique visual and gameplay style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover secret areas, find new weapons, enhance your abilities, and destroy any obstacles in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling a bit overwhelmed by it all? Relax for a moment and catch some fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Colorful, hand-crafted pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Powerful original soundtrack composed by Tantrum Tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple difficulties designed for a wide range of ages and skill levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Full keyboard and controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/extras/steam_gif_v4.gif?t=1744813123\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953070?t=1744813123","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953070?t=1744813123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744813123","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953070/capsule_184x69.jp